    ('pte-alfa-rwfib-12001335', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Fill in the Blanks (Dropdown)', 'Public Education', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.', 'Public education is generally free. However, many schools to [[b1]] to charge parents for extra services, [[b2]] as textbooks, excursions, and music lessons. Low-income families may not be able to afford [[b3]] costs, which puts their children at a disadvantage, especially when [[b4]] information.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["choose", "decide", "agree", "refuse"], "correctAnswer": "choose"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["such", "like", "same", "much"], "correctAnswer": "such"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["these", "those", "their", "extra"], "correctAnswer": "these"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["accessing", "arranging", "learning", "seeking"], "correctAnswer": "accessing"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Dropdown fill in the blanks.', 'medium', 4, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001335', 'g-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001335', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rwfib-12001334', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Fill in the Blanks (Dropdown)', 'Resultant Force', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.', 'The overall result of two or [[b1]] forces acting on an object is called the resultant force. The resultant of two forces is a single force, which has the same effect as the two forces combined. If two forces pull an object in [[b2]] directions, the size of the resultant can be found by [[b3]] one force from the other. If the forces are [[b4]], they balance each other.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["more", "less", "many", "several"], "correctAnswer": "more"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["opposite", "different", "both", "various"], "correctAnswer": "opposite"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["subtracting", "adding", "sharing", "dividing"], "correctAnswer": "subtracting"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["equal", "same", "balanced", "stable"], "correctAnswer": "equal"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Dropdown fill in the blanks.', 'medium', 4, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001334', 'g-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001334', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rwfib-12001333', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Fill in the Blanks (Dropdown)', 'Dogs & Humans', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.', 'Dogs, the first [[b1]] animals, evolved from East Asian wolves approximately 20,000-40,000 years ago. Dogs understand human body language, many spoken words, and even abstract symbols. Dogs pay attention to human faces and eyes, and they often [[b2]] to humans to help solve problems. Dogs and humans form a [[b3]] emotional bond that reduces stress in both species. Being [[b4]] dogs improve human physical and mental well-being. Most dogs are very social and play with other dogs if they can. Stray and feral dogs are common on the edges of human society. They form social groups, and sometimes cooperate in territorial defense, much as wolves do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["domestic", "wild", "tamed", "native"], "correctAnswer": "domestic"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["turn", "look", "refer", "come"], "correctAnswer": "turn"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["mutual", "common", "strong", "deep"], "correctAnswer": "mutual"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["around", "with", "near", "within"], "correctAnswer": "around"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Dropdown fill in the blanks.', 'medium', 4, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001333', 'g-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001333', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rwfib-12001332', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Fill in the Blanks (Dropdown)', 'Learning', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.', 'Learning to ride a bicycle as an adult can be challenging, especially for a beginner. A trained [[b1]] can guide learners through basic techniques and help them feel more [[b2]] on the road. The purpose is not to become a professional rider immediately, but to build balance and [[b3]]. Even an [[b4]] can improve with regular practice. Later, some learners may join outdoor events or friendly [[b5]].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["instructor", "coach", "teacher", "trainer"], "correctAnswer": "instructor"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["comfortable", "confident", "safe", "easy"], "correctAnswer": "comfortable"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["confidence", "strength", "balance", "skill"], "correctAnswer": "confidence"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["amateur", "beginner", "adult", "owner"], "correctAnswer": "amateur"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["competitions", "races", "parties", "events"], "correctAnswer": "competitions"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Dropdown fill in the blanks.', 'medium', 5, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001332', 'g-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001332', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rwfib-12001331', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-rw', 'Fill in the Blanks (Dropdown)', 'Charity Group', 'Below is a text with blanks. Click on each blank, a list of choices will appear. Select the appropriate answer choice for each blank.', 'Landing a position with the acclaimed charity group, often referred to as the [[b1]] providers, was a dream come true for Sarah. Although the organization could only offer a [[b2]] stipend, she eagerly [[b3]] the terms. She believed that working alongside such selfless individuals was far more [[b4]] than chasing a high corporate salary. Over the years, this dedicated group has continued to provide essential healthcare to impoverished communities worldwide, relying heavily on passionate workers who value purpose over financial gain.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["angel", "care", "health", "people"], "correctAnswer": "angel"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["meager", "small", "huge", "modest"], "correctAnswer": "meager"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["accepted", "agreed", "signed", "took"], "correctAnswer": "accepted"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["rewarding", "valuable", "meaningful", "decreasing"], "correctAnswer": "rewarding"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Dropdown fill in the blanks.', 'medium', 4, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001331', 'g-pte-alfa-rwfib-12001331', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rmcma-9000198', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Job Opening', 'Read the text and answer the question by selecting all the correct responses. More than one response is correct. Which of the following are provided according to the job advertisement?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "The possibility of part-time work"}, {"id": "B", "text": "fuel for the work vehicle"}, {"id": "C", "text": "A free course in Canada"}, {"id": "D", "text": "Paid meals when traveling"}, {"id": "E", "text": "Four weeks of holiday per year"}]'::jsonb, '["B", "D"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Select all correct options.', 'medium', 2, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000198', 'g-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000198', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rmcma-9000197', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Disciplined Inquiry', 'Read the text and answer the question by selecting all the correct responses. More than one response is correct. Which of the following limitations of research studies are mentioned in the passage?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "The full richness of the individuals and sites of the experiment cannot be captured by the research studies."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Some questions are not only answerable by research studies but they are also influenced by personal philosophy values and ethics."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Participants are not informed about the nature of the planned research."}, {"id": "D", "text": "It depends on the willingness of the participants in terms of providing data."}, {"id": "E", "text": "Variables and other aspects of a context are always examined in research studies."}]'::jsonb, '["A", "B", "D"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Select all correct options.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000197', 'g-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000197', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rmcma-9000196', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Migration', 'Read the text and answer the question by selecting all the correct responses. More than one response is correct. Which of the following statements about demographic challenges are supported by the text?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "Speeding up its sluggish pace of demographic \"transition\""}, {"id": "B", "text": "Receiving immigration from areas with high birth rates like Africa."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Sending immigration to different areas because Asian birth rates that are too high."}, {"id": "D", "text": "Mass Asian emigration to Africa."}, {"id": "E", "text": "Having more babies."}]'::jsonb, '["B", "E"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Select all correct options.', 'medium', 2, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000196', 'g-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000196', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rmcma-9000195', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Genome', 'Read the text and answer the question by selecting all the correct responses. More than one response is correct. Which of the following are true of personalized medicine according to the passage?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "People should not have genome screenings"}, {"id": "B", "text": "Physicians are gaining testing skills"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Personalized medicine will improve health care"}, {"id": "D", "text": "There are medical discoveries to be made through personalized medicine"}, {"id": "E", "text": "General medicine practices are becoming outdated"}, {"id": "F", "text": "Some diseases tend to be hereditary"}]'::jsonb, '["C", "E", "F"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Select all correct options.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000195', 'g-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000195', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rmcma-9000194', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reading-mcq-multiple', 'Multiple Choice, Multiple Answers', 'Attention', 'Read the text and answer the question by selecting all the correct responses. More than one response is correct. Which of the following findings are supported by the pigeon experiments?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "The pigeons were able to divide their attention among more than one stimulus."}, {"id": "B", "text": "Pigeons have a higher ability to focus their attention than most other animals."}, {"id": "C", "text": "Pigeons were most often correct when focusing on stimuli of yellow light and a high frequency tone."}, {"id": "D", "text": "The more attention they gave to one stimulus the less they could give to the other."}, {"id": "E", "text": "The pigeons'' performance varied According to the type of reward offered."}]'::jsonb, '["A", "D"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Select all correct options.', 'medium', 2, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, 'rp-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000194', 'g-pte-alfa-rmcma-9000194', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-ro-10001082', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Farmland and Forest', 'The text boxes below have been placed in a random order. Restore the original order.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p1", "text": "Seeds sprout, producing seedlings."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "They grow into saplings, which shade the lawn below."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "The saplings will grow into big trees, and eventually a forest will form."}, {"id": "p4", "text": "Farmland can be created by clearing forests."}, {"id": "p5", "text": "If the farmland is abandoned, the process will start over again."}]'::jsonb, '["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4", "p5"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Restore the original logical order of paragraphs.', 'medium', 4, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, NULL, NULL, 0, 'ri-pte-alfa-ro-10001082'),
    ('pte-alfa-ro-10001081', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Pest Control', 'The text boxes below have been placed in a random order. Restore the original order.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p1", "text": "Chemical pest control dates back 4,500 years, when the Sumerians used sulfur compounds as insecticides."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "The Rig Veda, which is about 4,000 years old, also mentions the use of poisonous plants for pest control."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "And the ancient Chinese and Egyptians are also known to have used chemical pest control."}, {"id": "p4", "text": "But it was only with the industrialization and mechanization of agriculture in the 18th and 19th centuries, and the introduction of the insecticides pyrethrum and derris that chemical pest control became the method of choice."}]'::jsonb, '["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Restore the original logical order of paragraphs.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, NULL, NULL, 0, 'ri-pte-alfa-ro-10001081'),
    ('pte-alfa-ro-10001080', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Forest Cycle', 'The text boxes below have been placed in a random order. Restore the original order.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p1", "text": "Seeds sprout from the soil and gradually develop into small seedlings."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "These seedlings continue to grow and eventually become young saplings."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "The saplings grow into large trees, and over time, a forest begins to form."}, {"id": "p4", "text": "The forest may later be cleared to create farmland for agricultural use."}, {"id": "p5", "text": "If the farmland is abandoned, natural vegetation begins to return and the process starts again."}]'::jsonb, '["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4", "p5"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Restore the original logical order of paragraphs.', 'medium', 4, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, NULL, NULL, 0, 'ri-pte-alfa-ro-10001080'),
    ('pte-alfa-ro-10001079', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Bugs', 'The text boxes below have been placed in a random order. Restore the original order.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p1", "text": "If the landlord refuses to deal with a bed bug infestation, the tenant can seek assistance from the government."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "Alternatively, the tenant may hire a professional exterminator directly."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "Because bed bugs are extremely difficult to eliminate, the work should be carried out by trained pest control professionals."}, {"id": "p4", "text": "If the tenant hires an exterminator independently, they should choose a reputable company and make sure the treatment is performed properly."}]'::jsonb, '["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Restore the original logical order of paragraphs.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, NULL, NULL, 0, 'ri-pte-alfa-ro-10001079'),
    ('pte-alfa-ro-10001078', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'reorder-paragraphs', 'Re-order Paragraphs', 'Whale', 'The text boxes below have been placed in a random order. Restore the original order.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "p1", "text": "Whales generally live in the water."}, {"id": "p2", "text": "However, as mammals, they must come to the surface to breathe."}, {"id": "p3", "text": "That''s why their breathing organ (blowhole) is located on the top of their heads."}, {"id": "p4", "text": "When they breathe out, they produce a spout of water vapor that looks like a fountain."}]'::jsonb, '["p1", "p2", "p3", "p4"]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Restore the original logical order of paragraphs.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 150, NULL, NULL, 0, 'ri-pte-alfa-ro-10001078'),
    ('pte-alfa-rfib-11001117', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks', 'Mountain Forest', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.', 'The place had both mountains and a [[b1]]. Every year, over 3.5 million [[b2]] come to enjoy the scenery. There are also several miles of [[b3]] that wind through the area.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "visitors"}, {"id": "B", "text": "forest"}, {"id": "C", "text": "desert"}, {"id": "D", "text": "kilometers"}, {"id": "E", "text": "travelers"}, {"id": "F", "text": "trails"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["visitors", "forest", "desert", "kilometers", "travelers", "trails"], "correctAnswer": "forest"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["visitors", "forest", "desert", "kilometers", "travelers", "trails"], "correctAnswer": "visitors"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["visitors", "forest", "desert", "kilometers", "travelers", "trails"], "correctAnswer": "trails"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Drag words into appropriate blanks.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 120, 'rp-pte-alfa-rfib-11001117', 'g-pte-alfa-rfib-11001117', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rfib-11001116', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks', 'Recycling Notice', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.', 'Today, many companies emphasize [[b1]] in their operations. For example, packaging should be made from recyclable materials to ensure proper [[b2]]. In households, using energy-efficient kitchen [[b3]] helps reduce environmental impact.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "sustainability"}, {"id": "B", "text": "maintenance"}, {"id": "C", "text": "gauge"}, {"id": "D", "text": "appliances"}, {"id": "E", "text": "bargain"}, {"id": "F", "text": "disposal"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["sustainability", "maintenance", "gauge", "appliances", "bargain", "disposal"], "correctAnswer": "sustainability"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["sustainability", "maintenance", "gauge", "appliances", "bargain", "disposal"], "correctAnswer": "disposal"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["sustainability", "maintenance", "gauge", "appliances", "bargain", "disposal"], "correctAnswer": "appliances"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Drag words into appropriate blanks.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 120, 'rp-pte-alfa-rfib-11001116', 'g-pte-alfa-rfib-11001116', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rfib-11001115', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks', 'Asking for Leave', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.', 'My son is [[b1]] to attend school. On the [[b2]] night I found he was [[b3]] and now I think it is better for him not to go to school so that we can avoid infection. I believe after some rest, he will become [[b4]] and will successfully pass his exam. And I am [[b5]] to help him catch up on the missed lessons.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "unable"}, {"id": "B", "text": "difficult"}, {"id": "C", "text": "sick"}, {"id": "D", "text": "well"}, {"id": "E", "text": "painful"}, {"id": "F", "text": "sorry"}, {"id": "G", "text": "previous"}, {"id": "H", "text": "happy"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["unable", "difficult", "sick", "well", "painful", "sorry", "previous", "happy"], "correctAnswer": "unable"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["unable", "difficult", "sick", "well", "painful", "sorry", "previous", "happy"], "correctAnswer": "previous"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["unable", "difficult", "sick", "well", "painful", "sorry", "previous", "happy"], "correctAnswer": "sick"}, {"id": "b4", "options": ["unable", "difficult", "sick", "well", "painful", "sorry", "previous", "happy"], "correctAnswer": "well"}, {"id": "b5", "options": ["unable", "difficult", "sick", "well", "painful", "sorry", "previous", "happy"], "correctAnswer": "happy"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Drag words into appropriate blanks.', 'medium', 5, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 120, 'rp-pte-alfa-rfib-11001115', 'g-pte-alfa-rfib-11001115', 1, NULL),
    ('pte-alfa-rfib-11001114', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'reading', 'fill-in-blanks-r', 'Reading: Fill in the Blanks', 'Lifelong Learning', 'In the text below some words are missing. Drag words from the box below to the appropriate place in the text. To undo an answer choice, drag the word back to the box below the text.', 'My grandmother may have an old body, but her [[b1]] hasn''t aged a day. She says it''s because of all the hobbies she still does, such as reading, baking, and gardening. She knows that learning should never stop. Every time you pick up a hobby, you learn [[b2]], new words, new techniques. Just like your body needs [[b3]] to stay fit, your brain needs learning to stay sharp!', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "A", "text": "new skills"}, {"id": "B", "text": "mind"}, {"id": "C", "text": "Time"}, {"id": "D", "text": "exercise"}, {"id": "E", "text": "thoughts"}, {"id": "F", "text": "items"}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id": "b1", "options": ["new skills", "mind", "Time", "exercise", "thoughts", "items"], "correctAnswer": "mind"}, {"id": "b2", "options": ["new skills", "mind", "Time", "exercise", "thoughts", "items"], "correctAnswer": "new skills"}, {"id": "b3", "options": ["new skills", "mind", "Time", "exercise", "thoughts", "items"], "correctAnswer": "exercise"}]'::jsonb, NULL, 'Drag words into appropriate blanks.', 'medium', 3, ARRAY['PTE', 'Alfa PTE', 'Reading']::text[], TRUE, 0, 120, 'rp-pte-alfa-rfib-11001114', 'g-pte-alfa-rfib-11001114', 1, NULL),
