    ('pte-alfa-ra-1001644', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'speaking', 'read-aloud', 'Read Aloud', 'Road bicycle racing', 'Look at the text below. In 35 seconds, you must read this text aloud as naturally and clearly as possible. You have 40 seconds to read aloud.', 'Road bicycle racing is the cycle sports discipline of road cycling, held on paved roads. Road racing is the most popular professional
