    ('pte-alfa-hiw-16000525', 'pte-2026-01', 'PTE', ARRAY['PTE']::text[], 'listening', 'pte-highlight-incorrect-word', 'Highlight Incorrect Word', 'Sacred Calling', 'You will hear a recording. Below is a transcription of the recording. Some words in the transcription differ from what the speaker said. Please click on the words that are different.', 'Now, a professor is also a member of a profession, presumably one that regards its discretion as a vocation in the full sense of the word - from vocare, ''to call''. Despite some modern uses that reduce it to the mere practicalities of motivation practice rather than theory, the product of training rather than education-vocation is more than this. A calling is both active and passive. It implies a sense of intention. It carries with it a guilty to be vocal.', 'https://cdn-alfastorage.alfapte.com/question-files/audio-73f0da43-b9ee-4256-9911-9c7ea65985f1.mp3', 'Now, a professor is also a member of a profession, presumably one that regards its discipline as a vocation in the full sense of the word - from vocare, ''to call''. Despite some modern uses that reduce it to the mere practicalities of employment practice rather than theory, the product of training rather than education-vocation is more than this. A calling is both active and passive. It implies a sense of purpose. It carries with it a duty to be vocal.', NULL, NULL, '[{"id": "w1", "text": "Now,"}, {"id": "w2", "text": "a"}, {"id": "w3", "text": "professor"}, {"id": "w4", "text": "is"}, {"id": "w5", "text": "also"}, {"id": "w6", "text": "a"}, {"id": "w7", "text": "member"}, {"id": "w8", "text": "of"}, {"id": "w9", "text": "a"}, {"id": "w10", "text": "profession,"}, {"id": "w11", "text": "presumably"}, {"id": "w12", "text": "one"}, {"id": "w13", "text": "that"}, {"id": "w14", "text": "regards"}, {"id": "w15", "text": "its"}, {"id": "w16", "text": "discretion"}, {"id": "w17", "text": "as"}, {"id": "w18", "text": "a"}, {"id": "w19", "text": "vocation"}, {"id": "w20", "